  "about": "Review sorting shared by every BYE app. Missing scores and unreadable dates sort last; ties fall back to newest first (oldest first for 'oldest'), then review ID. Dates may be ISO or RMP's '2026-05-01 00:00:00 +0000 UTC'. Swift: Ordering.reviews(_:by:) with ReviewSort cases of the same names. TypeScript: orderReviews(reviews, by).",
